endobj
181 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (The larger setting needed more venue space, fabrication, transport, equipment and materials. We could see the appeal on paper, but questioned whether those costs could be justified. We moved to compact booths to reduce the physical scope and focus spending on the core family activities.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Could a small team cover every area?)
