/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Personalisation, workshops, sampling, Q&A and sales each need preparation and staff coverage. Nine areas would stretch a small team thin. We consolidated into four booths with clearer responsibilities, including a shared reception and cashier point.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (More stations mean more queues, supplies and handovers to manage. Fewer separate service points make it easier for families to navigate and for staff to oversee. The revised layout keeps the passport journey, so families still move through the experience in a clear order.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
